<title>USA: Applied Digital wins BC Telecom contract.</title>
<headline>Applied Digital wins BC Telecom contract.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Digital Access Inc said Friday it had won a contract for installation services and provisioning software for management of BC Telecom Inc's digital cross-connect network.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Applied Digital said the order is scheduled for delivery and installation in the second half of 1997. It said it will supply BC Telecom with operations system software used in the management of public carrier transport networks worldwide.</p>
</text>
